{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Afters》是一款專為夜間外出拍攝而設的即棄相機工具，適合喜愛派對、夜店或朋友聚會紀錄的用家。它每次快門都會強制閃光，對焦固定，不設修圖，強調隨手拍下真實氣氛。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-198.webp\">\n<h2>固定對焦配六款底片風格</h2>\n<p>每次按下快門，閃光燈都會亮起，在昏暗房間留下硬光與真實面孔。對焦固定為人像 1 米或團體 2.5 米，一點即拍，不必等待。軟件不設修圖，拍攝前先選好底片風格與日期戳。六款底片風格包括 2AM、Gold、Mint、Noir、Digicam '04 與 Xpro，顆粒與光暈直接寫入相片。每卷 24 張，可選翌日上午 9 時沖洗後收到通知，或即時沖洗。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-41-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-42-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-43-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-44-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-45-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-46-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Afters: Night Flash Camera</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T22:58:57.047444+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":369,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:39:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T19:38:11.671647+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T22:57:43.061425+00:00","content_hash":"2aafc0df66c1fe9882b705a47cf95bb853882f831996388fce8a0617e01d7ce6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}